{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "spanish", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1757376000, "end_date": 1757980799, "month_true_total": 22, "quota": 5, "returned": 3, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:16:28 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "204365263", "author": {"steamid": "76561198991113455", "personaname": "Micky Myers", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198991113455/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 1140, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 996, "last_played": 1761863788, "avatar": "f5a2a84a3b771944e1ce9cfc3d65e537d61ecd1b"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Si lo recomiendo, es un juego dinamico, entretenido y frenetico, para jugar solo o con amigos mejor todavia.\r\nDe oferta vale mucho la pena tenerlo y ni hablar si te van los zombies.\r\n\r\nNo se por que lo comparan con Left 4 Dead, creo que las reseñas negativas son por esa boluda comparacion,  que es injusta.\r\n\r\nCompralo en oferta con todos los DLC, joyita!", "timestamp_created": 1757894385, "timestamp_updated": 1757894385, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204363835", "author": {"steamid": "76561198209740387", "personaname": "benja", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/56464564564564564645/", "num_games_owned": 35, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 14261, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 407, "playtime_at_review": 1357, "last_played": 1788049134, "avatar": "8847294cb8fa5f328c23946d5793a4da679bd7c8"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Entretenido pero muy complicado de aprender a primeras, muchas reglas y el sistema de cartas suma más cosas que saber y tener en cuenta al jugar, el menú e interfaz tampoco son muy amigables y no explican o enseñan muy bien, es una interfaz poco intuitiva. Para ser un juego muerto y cerrarán los servidores en poco tiempo, recomiendo comprarlo en oferta y solo la edición básica, nada de Dlc ni cosméticos, no lo valen, en cuanto a la campaña y los disparos es entretenido sin dudas.", "timestamp_created": 1757892540, "timestamp_updated": 1757892540, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494809657335281372", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204346136", "author": {"steamid": "76561199094076505", "personaname": "NIKLAS243", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199094076505/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 767, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 686, "last_played": 1780691116, "avatar": "6e57b456b30eb90251c242417fd0b45bc86bb61e"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "falta amigos\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1757874596, "timestamp_updated": 1757874596, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.514705896377563477", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}